   "start": 51.9,
   "end": 71.23,
   "en": "Here is how it worked. The scientists built a mini soccer field with a little ball and a small goal. When a bee pushed the ball into the goal — GOAL! — it got a sweet drink of sugar water as a prize. Bees love sweet things, so they learned fast.",
   "cn": "过程是这样的。科学家们搭建了一个迷你足球场，放了一颗小球和一个小球门。当蜜蜂把球推进球门——进球！——它就能喝到一杯甜甜的糖水作为奖励。蜜蜂最爱甜食，所以它们学得飞快。",
