  {
   "start": 71.23,
   "end": 95.12,
   "en": "But here is the amazing part. The bees did not just learn by trying again and again. They learned by watching! A \"teacher bee\" showed them how to push the ball, and the student bees copied it. Even cooler, some bees found a shorter, smarter path to the goal than the teacher showed them. They were not just copying — they were thinking!",
   "cn": "但最神奇的部分在这里。蜜蜂们不只是靠一次次尝试学会的，它们是靠“看”学会的！一只“老师蜜蜂”先示范怎么推球，学生蜜蜂们跟着模仿。更酷的是，有些蜜蜂找到了一条比老师示范的更短、更聪明的进球路线。它们不只是在模仿——它们在思考！",
