  {
   "start": 95.12,
   "end": 114.07,
   "en": "The most surprising moment came later. When the scientists tested the bees the next day, the bees still remembered how to score — they had not forgotten overnight! For a brain smaller than a grain of rice, that is like remembering a whole dance routine after seeing it only once.",
   "cn": "最惊人的时刻还在后面。第二天科学家再测试这些蜜蜂时，它们居然还记得怎么进球——一夜过去完全没忘！对一颗比米粒还小的大脑来说，这就像只看了一遍就记住了一整套舞蹈动作。",
